{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50209","headline":"秋夜弹碁鼓琴歌 · 房元阳","name":"秋夜弹碁鼓琴歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"流月泛艳兮露色圆，（「圆」，项云当作「团」。\n）拂孤□兮弄清丝（弦）[一]。\n幽态窈窕兮断复连，惊风中路兮迢[二]流年。\n浮荣轻薄兮欲何贤，流商激楚兮不能宣。\n（[一]依刘校。\n[二]俞疑「迢」当是「送」字之误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"房元阳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50209.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50209","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}